Select Linux UAPI headers independently of the target libc ABI.

The supplier maps unconstrained GNU targets to Linux 4.19 headers with
its glibc 2.28 default. gVisor needs newer declarations without changing
libc or execution-platform constraints. Add a root-module default while
preserving explicit kernel constraints and the unset libc-derived fallback.

Upstream interface at the pinned release:
https://github.com/hermeticbuild/hermetic-llvm/blob/39e71f939/kernel/extension/kernel_headers.bzl
https://github.com/hermeticbuild/hermetic-llvm/blob/39e71f939/kernel/extension/make_select_kernel_headers_repository_target.bzl

Temporary upstream candidate: remove when the supplier exposes this setting.

